        <h3>About the author</h3>
        <p><p><strong>Eric Nusbaum</strong> is a semi-transient Los Angeles native. His favorite character in &#8220;The Godfather&#8221; is Tom Hagen and his favorite Rolling Stone is, and always will be, Keith Richards. A graduate of the University of Washington in Seattle, he scrapes by on writing, politics, and the occasional train robbery. You can read his ever-evolving thoughts on the infield fly rule, iambic pentameter, and life at <a href="https://www.pitchersandpoets.com">Pitchers &amp; Poets</a>.</p>
</p>
